// M3 — The Construct (M7.6). Dixie aboard; Berne recon.
=== brief ===
# page:text
Dixie Flatline is in the Hosaka. Gray ice, then Berne. Don't touch the cube.
* [JACK IN] -> END

=== debrief ===
# page:text
The cube of white light looked back. Dixie talked you home. Wintermute knows the name.
* [DONE] -> END
